{"seq":3,"slug":"drd-decision-composition-engine-portability","title":"DRD 决策组合、决策服务复用与跨引擎可移植性陷阱","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/business-rule-decision-engine-rete-dmnn-drools-cel-opa/dmn-decision-table-expression/drd-decision-composition-engine-portability","wordCount":2898,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"drd-决策组合-决策服务复用与跨引擎可移植性陷阱\">DRD 决策组合、决策服务复用与跨引擎可移植性陷阱</h1><p>&quot;落地成本&quot;（landed cost）在跨境电商里通常被至少三处分别计算：结账页的预估、下单后的应付、清关结算时的实付。三处若各维护一套决策表，问题不是谁的算法对，而是<strong>三套规则何时开始漂移</strong>——优惠券叠加口径改一次、某国 VAT 起征点调一次，只要有一处没跟上，同一笔订单就在三个界面给出三个数字。把决策做成图（DRD）并用决策服务封装，是让&quot;一次修改、多处生效&quot;成为结构保证；可移植性是同一件事的镜像——复用一旦跨越引擎边界，图上写的语义与引擎实际执行的语义就不再是同一个东西。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-drd-是依赖图-决策服务是复用单元\">核心概念：DRD 是依赖图，决策服务是复用单元</h2><p>DMN 把决策建模为有向图。DRD（Decision Requirements Diagram）由五类节点构成——<strong>decision</strong>（可求值的决策）、<strong>input data</strong>（外部输入）、<strong>business knowledge model</strong>（BKM）、<strong>knowledge source</strong>（权威来源/法规依据）与 <strong>decision service</strong>（决策服务）；边有三类——information requirement（数据依赖）、knowledge requirement（调用 BKM）、authority requirement（决策归属）。OMG 的 DMN 正式合规版本为 <strong>1.6</strong>（2026 年 9 月发布），规范页同时列出 <strong>1.7 beta</strong>（informational，不构成合规声明，<code>https://www.omg.org/spec/DMN/</code>）。</p>\n<p>有一条常被混淆的分界：<strong>决策表描述&quot;一个决策如何求值&quot;，DRD 描述&quot;多个决策如何依赖&quot;</strong>。决策表的求值语义与完备性校验见 <a href=\"dmn-decision-table-hit-policy-completeness\">同章第一篇</a>，表达式类型语义见 <a href=\"feel-expression-type-semantics\">同章第二篇</a>；本篇讨论决策表之上的组合层与复用层。部署形态（嵌进程 vs sidecar vs 决策服务 API）是正交问题，见 <a href=\"../rule-engine-model-decision-architecture/decision-service-architecture-embedded-vs-sidecar\">决策服务架构</a>。</p>\n<p>图上的依赖可形式化。设决策 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 的直接信息需求集合为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{ir}(d)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">ir</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，求值它真正需要的输入是传递闭包 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></mrow><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">∗</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∪</mo><msub><mo>⋃</mo><mrow><msup><mi>d</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msub><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></mrow><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">∗</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>d</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{req}^{*}(d) = \\mathrm{ir}(d) \\cup \\bigcup_{d&#x27; \\in \\mathrm{ir}(d)} \\mathrm{req}^{*}(d&#x27;)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">req</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">ir</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∪</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2266em;vertical-align:-0.4747em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">⋃</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2253em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6828em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.786em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">ir</span></span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4747em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">req</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，一次求值即映射 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo>:</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></mrow><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">∗</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msub><mo>→</mo><msub><mi>Y</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_d: X_{\\mathrm{req}^{*}(d)} \\to Y_d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0385em;vertical-align:-0.3552em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5198em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">req</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6183em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.786em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3552em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></mrow><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">∗</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|\\mathrm{req}^{*}(d)|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">req</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span> 决定调用方要准备的输入向量有多大，也决定缓存键长度——这是后面成本讨论的起点。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>DRD 节点/边</th>\n<th>语义与复用含义</th>\n<th>跨境典型用法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>decision</td>\n<td>有求值语义的节点（决策表/字面表达式/上下文），可作为复用单元的出口</td>\n<td>&quot;计算应缴关税&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>input data</td>\n<td>由外部提供的原子输入，构成复用单元的契约面</td>\n<td>目的国、HS 编码、订单金额</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>business knowledge model</td>\n<td>可复用逻辑（含参数化函数），横向复用而非层级依赖</td>\n<td>汇率换算、区间分段工具</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>knowledge source</td>\n<td>权威来源（法规、政策文档），只有溯源价值无求值语义</td>\n<td>欧盟 VAT 规则、平台费率公告</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>decision service</td>\n<td>打包一组决策并声明接口，是纵向复用单元</td>\n<td>&quot;落地成本测算&quot;整体对外</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>information requirement</td>\n<td>数据依赖，决定求值闭包与失效范围</td>\n<td>关税 → 税费合计</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"决策服务的封装语义-输入决策-输出决策与内部的中间量\">决策服务的封装语义：输入决策、输出决策与内部的中间量</h2><p>决策服务是 DRM 里唯一的<strong>复用封装单元</strong>：把一组内部决策打包，并声明 <strong>input decisions</strong> 与 <strong>output decisions</strong> 两个接口面。关键在 <strong>input decision 的双重身份</strong>——它既由服务内部规则计算，又允许调用方传入值来<strong>覆盖</strong>该内部计算。这解决跨境电商最常见的一类耦合：模型默认用实时汇率折算本币，月末结算却必须用会计锁定的月均汇率；汇率若是决策表里的输入列则无从覆盖，建模成 input decision 就能不改模型地注入锁定汇率。上游决策（如&quot;会员等级&quot;）同样可建模为 input decision。不被外露的中间决策则是另一种价值：把&quot;是否触发低值包裹免税&quot;留在服务内部，将来拆成两步、加一层风控，都不构成接口变更。</p>\n<p>三条来自真实踩坑的约束：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>input decision 的覆盖语义必须写进契约。</strong> DMN 允许覆盖，但&quot;覆盖后服务内部是否还执行该决策自身的规则&quot;取决于调用约定与引擎实现，不能靠推断。把可覆盖项列成显式清单（字段、类型、默认来源、谁有权覆盖）。</li>\n<li><strong>不要把纯数据伪装成决策。</strong> input data 与 decision 混用会让求值闭包虚胖：调用方被迫准备本可由引擎推导的输入，缓存键变长、命中率下降。</li>\n<li><strong>权威来源用 knowledge source 边声明。</strong> 关税税率挂到具体法规节点上，调税率时沿 authority requirement 边就能列出所有需复核的决策。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"组合的代价-图深度-重复求值与缓存失效\">组合的代价：图深度、重复求值与缓存失效</h2><p>DRD 的层级看起来天然，但<strong>图深度直接决定朴素的求值成本与失效半径</strong>。设决策 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 的传递消费者数量为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">∗</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|\\mathrm{cons}^{*}(d)|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">cons</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span>，一次端到端求值中朴素实现重复计算它的次数为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">∗</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V = \\sum_{d \\in D} |\\mathrm{cons}^{*}(d)|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0771em;vertical-align:-0.3271em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1864em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3271em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">cons</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span>，而理想情况（同一输入向量只算一次）是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>D</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V = |D|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span>，差值就是记忆化（memoization）能消掉的部分。落地方式是把缓存键定为三元组 <code>(决策 id, 模型版本, 输入向量哈希)</code>——<strong>键里必须含模型版本</strong>，否则热更新规则后旧缓存会继续返回上一版结果，这在&quot;改完规则要立刻止血&quot;的场景里是致命的。</p>\n<p>深度还有第二个代价：<strong>失效半径</strong>。第 3 层的中间决策一改，全部下游输出都被污染；扁平结构里改动只影响单表。因此有一条实用建议：<strong>把变化频率相近的决策放在同一层</strong>——税率换算按月变、促销按日变、风控阈值按小时变，混在同一层意味着每次小时级调整都要回归整条链；实践中把 DRD 控制在三到五层、每层承载一种变化频率。缓存键还要覆盖 input decision 的覆盖：A 请求传入锁定汇率、B 请求没有，若键只含业务输入，两次请求就会互相污染。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph DS[决策服务: 落地成本测算]&#10;      ID1[input decision&lt;br/&gt;优惠后金额] --&gt; L1[应缴关税]&#10;      ID2[input decision&lt;br/&gt;会员等级] --&gt; F1[可享运费方式]&#10;      HS[input data&lt;br/&gt;HS 编码] --&gt; T1[关税税率]&#10;      ID3[input decision&lt;br/&gt;目的国] --&gt; T1&#10;      T1 --&gt; L1&#10;      L1 --&gt; S1[税费合计]&#10;      ID4[input decision&lt;br/&gt;汇率] --&gt; S1&#10;      F1 --&gt; S2[总落地成本]&#10;      S1 --&gt; S2&#10;    end&#10;    C1[结账页预估] --&gt; DS&#10;    C2[下单应付] --&gt; DS&#10;    C3[清关结算] --&gt; DS&#10;    S2 --&gt; R[输出: 落地成本]&#10;    F1 --&gt; R\">graph TD\n    subgraph DS[决策服务: 落地成本测算]\n      ID1[input decision&lt;br/&gt;优惠后金额] --&gt; L1[应缴关税]\n      ID2[input decision&lt;br/&gt;会员等级] --&gt; F1[可享运费方式]\n      HS[input data&lt;br/&gt;HS 编码] --&gt; T1[关税税率]\n      ID3[input decision&lt;br/&gt;目的国] --&gt; T1\n      T1 --&gt; L1\n      L1 --&gt; S1[税费合计]\n      ID4[input decision&lt;br/&gt;汇率] --&gt; S1\n      F1 --&gt; S2[总落地成本]\n      S1 --&gt; S2\n    end\n    C1[结账页预估] --&gt; DS\n    C2[下单应付] --&gt; DS\n    C3[清关结算] --&gt; DS\n    S2 --&gt; R[输出: 落地成本]\n    F1 --&gt; R</pre><p>三个调用方消费的是<strong>同一个决策服务的两个输出</strong>：结账页只要&quot;运费方式&quot;用于展示，结算要&quot;总落地成本&quot;用于对账。输出决策的分层让不同调用方各取所需，不必各自复制整张图。</p>\n<h2 id=\"复用策略-bkm-import-与-引用而非内联\">复用策略：BKM、Import 与&quot;引用而非内联&quot;</h2><p>复用的三个层次混用，是最常见的模型腐化来源。<strong>第一层是 BKM</strong>，横向复用无副作用逻辑（汇率换算、区间分段取档、金额取整与分摊残差），判据是一段逻辑若要在图上被多条边各自实现一遍，它就是 BKM 候选。<strong>第二层是决策服务</strong>，纵向复用一组有依赖关系的决策——上一节的&quot;落地成本测算&quot;就是，它对外暴露接口、对内保留演化自由。<strong>第三层是跨模型 Import</strong>：DMN 自 1.2 起支持从另一个模型导入 DRG 元素（决策、BKM、input data 等），1.6 沿用并更新了命名空间，这是&quot;同一份税率表被计价模型、结算模型、合规模型共用&quot;的正解。注意 Apache KIE 已把早期的 <code>invoke</code> 机制标注为 deprecated，建议改用标准 Import——依赖 <code>invoke</code> 会让模型绑死在单一引擎上。</p>\n<p>为什么坚持&quot;引用而非内联&quot;，可用成本模型说明。设一次规则变更的修改成本为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>、下游回归成本为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r&lt;c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>，因为回归可自动化），内联进 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 个消费者的总成本为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>inline</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{inline}} = N(c+r)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">inline</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，引用式复用为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>ref</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>N</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{ref}} = c + Nr</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ref</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span>，差值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(N-1)c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N=3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 时看似不大，但消费者数量随渠道扩张线性增长：新增市场站点、接入新 ERP、上线 B2B 报价页，都会再多一份内联副本。<strong>内联模型的债务随渠道数量增长，而非随模型变大增长</strong>——这正是它在早期最容易被低估的原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"跨引擎可移植性陷阱与合规基线\">跨引擎可移植性陷阱与合规基线</h2><p>DMN 的设计目标之一是模型可交换（XML 序列化 + DMNDI 图形交换），但&quot;模型能导入&quot;与&quot;执行结果一致&quot;是两件事。以下六类差异按踩坑频率排序。</p>\n<p>| 风险类别 | 具体表现 | 缓解做法 ||---------|---------|---------|\n| 一致性级别（conformance level） | 规范按级别界定引擎必须支持的能力（决策表、S-FEEL、完整 FEEL） | 核对引擎<strong>声明</strong>的级别，确认覆盖用到的命中策略与 FEEL 子集 |\n| 命名空间与版本 | DMN 1.6 更新了命名空间；Apache KIE 10.2.0 声明支持 &quot;new DMN 1.6 namespaces&quot; | 升级前跑一遍旧模型导入，把命名空间迁移作为独立变更 |\n| 私有扩展元素 | Camunda 的 <code>camunda:</code> 属性、KIE 扩展前缀等 <code>extensionElements</code> 属引擎私有 | <strong>不把业务语义藏进扩展元素</strong>，仅用其承载展示性元数据 |\n| FEEL 方言 | <code>null</code> 传播、<code>date and time</code> 时区归一、collect 聚合、字符串函数覆盖度各家不同 | 只用规范定义的函数与语法，把差异写成显式清单 |\n| 决策服务支持度 | 部分引擎只执行单张决策表，不执行封装为 decision service 的图 | 交付前确认整图可执行，或记录 &quot;flatten 后的等价单表&quot; |\n| 命中策略与聚合 | 同一 <code>COLLECT</code> 表在不同实现对空命中、聚合初值的处理不一致 | 用 TCK 用例覆盖，而非只覆盖业务用例 |</p>\n<p><strong>客观基线是 DMN TCK</strong>（<code>https://github.com/dmn-tck/tck</code>），按 DMN 版本维护合规测试用例，覆盖决策表语义与 FEEL 求值。它接入 CI 的价值在于：它测的不是你的业务规则，而是<strong>引擎对标准的偏离</strong>——业务用例会全绿，因为业务用例是照着当前引擎行为写的。KIE 侧另有 <code>DMNRuntime#getMessages</code> 暴露决策表的解析告警与命中统计，可作为模型健康度的常驻指标。</p>\n<p>跨境场景还应加一条业务侧回归：<strong>同一批真实脱敏订单在两个候选引擎上跑出两个结果集，逐字段比对并按决策归因</strong>。差异会精确落在 <code>null</code> 处理、时区、聚合三个高频区，这正是评估迁移成本的真实依据。若模型依赖产生式引擎的议程机制而非 DMN 的纯函数求值，组合语义会整体改变，范式边界见 <a href=\"../rule-engine-model-decision-architecture/tabular-vs-production-rule-vs-policy-model\">决策表示的三种范式选型</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>DRD 的价值不在画得好看，而在于它把&quot;决策之间的依赖&quot;变成了可机械分析的制品：依赖闭包决定调用方契约，图深度决定求值成本与失效半径，决策服务决定复用单元。三条可执行判据：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>契约面显式化</strong>：决策服务把 input decisions（含可覆盖项清单）、输出决策、内部决策分开声明，覆盖语义写进接口文档而非靠命名暗示。</li>\n<li><strong>复用引用化</strong>：横向逻辑进 BKM，纵向结构进决策服务，跨模型共享进 Import；内联债务随渠道数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 线性增长 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(N-1)c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li><strong>可移植性声明化</strong>：模型头部记录&quot;目标引擎 + 声明的一致性级别 + 使用的扩展元素 + 方言清单&quot;，TCK 进 CI，跨引擎差异由真实订单比对归因。把不可移植的部分<strong>写下来</strong>，比假装它可移植便宜得多。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"DRD 决策组合、决策服务复用与跨引擎可移植性陷阱","id":"drd-决策组合-决策服务复用与跨引擎可移植性陷阱"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：DRD 是依赖图，决策服务是复用单元","id":"核心概念-drd-是依赖图-决策服务是复用单元"},{"level":2,"text":"决策服务的封装语义：输入决策、输出决策与内部的中间量","id":"决策服务的封装语义-输入决策-输出决策与内部的中间量"},{"level":2,"text":"组合的代价：图深度、重复求值与缓存失效","id":"组合的代价-图深度-重复求值与缓存失效"},{"level":2,"text":"复用策略：BKM、Import 与\"引用而非内联\"","id":"复用策略-bkm-import-与-引用而非内联"},{"level":2,"text":"跨引擎可移植性陷阱与合规基线","id":"跨引擎可移植性陷阱与合规基线"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"FEEL 表达式与类型语义：类型系统、区间、列表与日期函数","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/business-rule-decision-engine-rete-dmnn-drools-cel-opa/dmn-decision-table-expression/feel-expression-type-semantics"},"next":{"title":"规则版本管理、发布/灰度/回滚与决策审计追踪","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/business-rule-decision-engine-rete-dmnn-drools-cel-opa/rule-governance-testing-ops/rule-versioning-release-rollback-audit"}}